WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.072 --> 00:00:15.668
Tu fais le ménage le week-end ?
Do you do the housework on weekends?

2
00:00:15.768 --> 00:00:20.468
Oui, je passe l'aspirateur et je fais la vaisselle.
Yes, I vacuum and do the dishes.

3
00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:25.316
Moi, je dois faire la lessive et ranger ma chambre.
I have to do the laundry and tidy my room.

4
00:00:25.416 --> 00:00:28.724
Tu dois aussi faire les courses ?
Do you also have to do the shopping?

5
00:00:28.824 --> 00:00:32.444
Oui, mais je peux les faire demain.
Yes, but I can do it tomorrow.

6
00:00:32.544 --> 00:00:36.356
Alors on se retrouve dimanche après-midi !
Then let's meet on Sunday afternoon!
